    "body":  "Closes #28 (after this **module-only VERIFIED** evidence PR merges; the implementation Issue is not closed merely by opening this PR).\n\n## Scope\nIndependent acceptance closure for SR-003 from IMPLEMENTED to **VERIFIED (module AC-003-01～04 only)** following implementation PR #34 and governance PR #41. This is documentation-only (nine central Markdown documents), preserving original implementation and CI artifacts:\n- `SR-003` v0.3.11, acceptance evidence v0.2.6, acceptance baseline v0.3.17.\n- SR index v0.3.31, status overview v0.3.33, feature tree v0.6.22.\n- Cross-repo audit v0.4.36, documentation index v0.4.32.\n- Implementation route v0.2.5 fixes a *preexisting stale* #34 OPEN/dirty/CI NOT_RUN report and revision table.\n\n## Independently checked evidence\n- PR #34 final Head `e8bcb1b89de5094a4b1b68f973af6720801c7fbd` and merged commit `32c7c1be5e93bddc83349234476b2ffa09e1ca23`: identical Git Tree `30c95b616f57c692199152ea21d9e7e216a10455`.\n- PR #41 final Head `f3f59b54e19d317e8e8056e5a15963c3fd038aaf` and merged commit `a899409ea7bf2ffde20ea2d62a9b4a310fb5638c`: identical Git Tree `378f36ad63d8724eab98361997d72cbb41d42f7a`.\n- [Implementation SR-003 CI Run #45815167442](https://github.com/odango-chan/ca-agent-next/actions/runs/45815167442) **SUCCESS** and [post-backfill Run #45817800342](https://github.com/odango-chan/ca-agent-next/actions/runs/45817800342) **SUCCESS**. For *each* run, Ubuntu/Python 3.12 and Windows/Python 3.14 jobs ran **87 plugin, 52 host, 80 review context** tests, and Go Echo build, compileall, evidence capture all succeeded (read original workflow steps and job logs).\n- Test definitions in `tests/test_plugin.py` cover: AC-003-01 Manifest/Schema/path rejection; AC-003-02 three Extensions/process lifecycle/IPC/shutdown; AC-003-03 ingress Event/Host once vs zero; AC-003-04 dual Callable, Delivery, pending cancellation, late/too_late/unsupported results and generic Driver interface. Four module ACs PASS.\n- Historic local `docs/验收与实施/证据/SR-003/evidence.json` is retained as a historic local test artifact, with `ci=NOT_RUN` pertaining only to old `504ec1b` baseline; CI evidence is anchored by the GitHub runs above and is **not** falsely backdated into the historic artifact.\n\n## Non-goals\n- No product code/test changes, no changes to `main`.\n- EX-02/03/04/18, complete E2E, SR-010 Provider v2 wire DTO/real adapter, and macOS/other Python versions remain NOT_RUN/out of scope. These are **not** extra prerequisites for SR-003 module VERIFIED under SR 管理规范 §6/§9.\n- Current 27 SR states become **4 VERIFIED / 1 IMPLEMENTED / 22 DRAFT**. Issue #28 may close only *after* this evidence backfill is merged; there is no claim of full system qualification.\n\n## Review/account caveat\nThis is an independent technical examination of source/tests and actual CI evidence, not a separate GitHub identity\u0027s APPROVE review. User has authorized continued task processing. Do not claim a formal non-author APPROVE.\n",
